{"4452150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Coffee Break Paradise", "steam_appid": 4452150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coffee Break Paradise is a management simulator where you build, customize, and run your own coffee shop. Serve unique customers, discover special recipes, expand your business, and turn a simple kiosk into a coffee empire. Explore vibrant environments, unlock exclusive equipment, and face daily challenges to become the most popular barista in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and decorate your coffee shop with complete creative freedom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources, staff, and inventory to keep your customers happy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and improve recipes for coffee, pastries, and special drinks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face seasonal events and unique daily challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to relax, create, and expand your very own coffee paradise!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coffee Break Paradise is a management simulator where you build, customize, and run your own coffee shop. Serve unique customers, discover special recipes, expand your business, and turn a simple kiosk into a coffee empire. Explore vibrant environments, unlock exclusive equipment, and face daily challenges to become the most popular barista in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and decorate your coffee shop with complete creative freedom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources, staff, and inventory to keep your customers happy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and improve recipes for coffee, pastries, and special drinks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face seasonal events and unique daily challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to relax, create, and expand your very own coffee paradise!</p>", "short_description": "A café management game focused on customer flow, service interactions, and time optimization. The player controls a waiter/waitress who interacts with customers, takes orders, serves food, and keeps the environment organized.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452150/608f2920fd314ccc58063c6fccde56e76face0ff/header.jpg?t=1783040379", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452150/caaa8f473a33b13975a6451a737dd8f079b06064/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783040379", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452150/caaa8f473a33b13975a6451a737dd8f079b06064/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783040379", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5-4210U (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce 820M (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core I5-10600kf (or equivalent/superior)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050TI (or equivalent/superior)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Mini